    {
      "parameters": {
        "promptType": "define",
        "text": "=Analyze this support issue:\n{{ $('Read New Support Tickets').item.json.Issue }}\n\nClean category from the Janitor stage:\n{{ $json.output.clean_category }}\n\n1. Classify urgency as exactly High, Medium, or Low.\n- High: active outage, security/account compromise, blocked payment or critical transaction, data loss, safety, legal/compliance exposure, or a severe issue stopping business operations.\n- Medium: material degradation or customer-impacting issue that needs prompt attention but has a workaround or limited impact.\n- Low: information request, minor inconvenience, general query, or non-urgent administrative change.\n2. Write a short, polite suggested response that acknowledges the issue and sets an appropriate next step. Do not promise a resolution time that was not provided.\n\nReturn only the structured output requested by the parser.",
        "hasOutputParser": true,
        "options": {
          "systemMessage": "You are the Triage Officer stage of a customer-support workflow. Apply the urgency rules consistently and draft concise, professional responses."
        }
      },
      "id": "0d5d79e7-4763-4a2b-b5d9-9114509a1915",
      "name": "AI Agent 2 - Triage Officer",
      "type": "@n8n/n8n-nodes-langchain.agent",
      "typeVersion": 1.7,
      "position": [
        1040,
