      "parameters": {
        "content": "## Setup before first run\n1. Select Google Sheets, OpenAI, and Gmail credentials.\n2. Replace `YOUR_EMAIL@example.com`.\n3. Confirm that both Google Sheets nodes point to the imported `SupportTickets` spreadsheet.\n4. Activate the workflow, then POST to the production webhook URL.\n\nThe Janitor compares each ticket with the full batch and drops only later duplicates. All unique tickets are logged; only High urgency tickets trigger email.",
